### Test 1: Change Status - Disable unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "unitStatus": 0
}

### Test 2: Change Status - Re-enable unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "unitStatus": 1
}

### Test 3: Change Status - Suspend unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "unitStatus": 3
}

### Test 4: Change Status - Invalid (status out of catalog)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "unitStatus": 99
}

### Test 5: Change Status - Invalid (unitId missing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitStatus": 0
}

### Test 6: Change Status - Unit not accessible
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatus
